    },
    {
      "title": "Assign a home for each item",
      "detail": "Once you've decluttered, assign a designated spot for each item you're keeping. This could be a specific drawer, shelf, or bin. This will help keep your office organized and make it easier to find what you need when you need it."
    },
    {
