      "detail": "Make the most of your small space by using wall-mounted shelves, hooks, and storage units. This will help keep your floors and surfaces clear and create more space for working."
    },
    {
      "title": "Invest in multi-functional furniture",
      "detail": "Choose furniture that serves multiple purposes, such as a desk with built-in storage or a storage ottoman that doubles as a seat. This will help reduce clutter and make the most of your space."
