    {
      "title": "Find Your Favorite Genre",
      "detail": "Experiment with different genres and authors to find what you enjoy reading. This will make reading more enjoyable and increase your chances of sticking to your habit. You can also join a book club or ask friends for recommendations to discover new authors and genres."
