  "summary": "Starting a small indoor herb garden is a simple and rewarding process. By following these steps, you can create a thriving indoor herb garden that will provide you with a constant supply of fresh herbs for your cooking. With a little care and attention, your indoor herb garden will be a great addition to your home."
